Ports and extends the repository pattern MiaAI-Lab established for
single-DGX-Spark serving kits (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark-TensorFold,
MIT). The MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL EXL3 checkpoint this kit serves is
benthecarman/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL-exl3 (Hugging Face); underlying weights are
XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL under the Xiaomi model license, downloaded at
deploy time and NOT part of this repository.

The container image is based on NVIDIA's PyTorch container
(nvcr.io/nvidia/pytorch; NVIDIA license terms print at container start and
apply to that software). exllamav3 (MIT, turboderp), TabbyAPI (Apache-2.0,
theroyallab/TabbyAPI).

